            "text": "<p>Transform your space without the wait for international shipping. Our Muscat warehouse is stocked with Shein's full home and living range, ready for 48-hour delivery across Oman.</p><p>Cash on delivery  ·  Easy returns  ·  Outlet prices</p>",
